re reads a null header, as a dict field does. Only a MaybeList field treats null as None.\n\nScimark: ArrayList.data cannot be List(Array(d)) while it shares one slot with Array2D.data's flat array; that needs per-concrete-class field types (P-nested-lists part C).","files":null}]}